+	/**
+	 * Rewrites resource links (e.g. {@code /webjars/bootstrap/...}) to their versioned
+	 * form when templates build them through {@code response.encodeURL}. Spring Boot
+	 * registered this filter as part of its Thymeleaf auto-configuration; Tessera links
+	 * also go through {@code encodeURL}, so it is registered here explicitly.
+	 * @return the filter registration
